# geode.spr: Geode Runner's sprites, CG6 (CSS=0) on a blue background.
# G green, Y yellow, B blue, R red; "." is transparent.
#
# "halo 0": masked sprites, drawing only their own pixels, so the ladders
# and bricks behind them show through; the game erases a sprite by
# redrawing the tiles under it.  12 rows, the height of a cell.

sprite hero cg6 halo 0 bg B
..GG..
.GGGG.
.YYYY.
.Y.YY.
..YY..
GGGGGG
Y.GG.Y
..GG..
.G..G.
.G..G.
GG..GG
......
end

sprite guard cg6 halo 0 bg B
R....R
.RRRR.
RRRRRR
RYRRYR
RRRRRR
.RRRR.
RRRRRR
R.RR.R
..RR..
.R..R.
RR..RR
......
end
